  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\">The Functional Mushroom Company supplies the UK’s highest-quality medicinal mushroom extracts. Powerful, therapeutic-grade formulations designed for people who want real, measurable results. Every extract is hand-selected by mycologists, verified by independent labs, and crafted with synergistic pairings proven to elevate potency and bioavailability. No gimmicks. Just the most effective fungi on earth.</p><ul><li style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\"><strong>Only Therapeutic-Strength Extracts -&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">We never sell weak powders or blends. Every product contains clinically relevant doses designed to create real outcomes.</span></li><li style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>Independently Verified Potency -&nbsp;</strong>Every batch is third-party tested and Purity-IQ certified, guaranteeing accurate levels of the key bioactive compounds that matter.</span></li><li style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>Mycologist-Led, Synergistic Formulations -&nbsp;</strong>Our products are designed by expert mycologists using synergistic pairings that enhance efficacy and bioavailability.</span></li><li style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>Sustainable, Luxury Packaging -&nbsp;</strong>Premium, refillable glass jars with home-compostable refill pouches. Better for the planet and your daily ritual.</span></li><li style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>Free Starter Kit With Every Subscription -&nbsp;</strong>Every subscriber receives a complete kit to make daily use effortless from day one.</span></li></ul><p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Commission</span></strong></p><p data-start=\"282\" data-end=\"554\" id=\"isPasted\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Earn 30% commission on any referred orders you generate.<br data-start=\"394\" data-end=\"397\"></span></p><p data-start=\"282\" data-end=\"554\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">We’re looking for affiliate partners who can drive high-intent customers interested in long-term wellness routines, so subscription traffic is highly valued.</span></p></div></div>",
